>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"page-transition-frame\"></div><span class=\"page-transition-mark\">L</span></div><div class=\"site site--loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link nav-link--active\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/reviews\"><span>Reviews</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>07</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link site-nav-mobile-link--active\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>08</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><main class=\"editorial-page page-contact\"><section class=\"editorial-hero contact-hero\"><div class=\"editorial-hero-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">08</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Contact the Lathrop Team</p></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"editorial-hero-title\">Let’s talk about<em>what comes next.</em></h1></div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-hero-description\">Whether you are buying, selling, or simply starting to explore your options, we are here to listen and help you find a clearer path forward.</p></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-actions\"><a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn btn--light\">Send us a message</a></div></div><div class=\"editorial-hero-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</div><div class=\"editorial-hero-footnote\"><span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span><span class=\"editorial-hero-footnote-line\"></span><span>Buying · Selling · Planning</span></div></section><section class=\"contact-intro\"><div class=\"contact-intro-aside\"><span class=\"editorial-section-number\">01 — Start here</span><span class=\"contact-intro-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">L</span></div><div class=\"contact-intro-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>A conversation, not a commitment</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">Clear guidance starts<em>with a simple hello.</em></h2></div><div class=\"contact-intro-copy\"><p>Every move begins in a different place. You may be ready to start searching, preparing to sell, or simply looking for a better understanding of the market.</p><p>Tell us a little about what you are considering. The Lathrop Team will follow up personally to answer questions and help you identify the right next step.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-form-section\" id=\"contact-form\"><div class=\"contact-form-intro\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow editorial-eyebrow--light\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Send a message</p><h2>How can we<em>help you move?</em></h2><p>Share a few details below. We will review your message and follow up personally as soon as we can.</p></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"contact-form-assurance\"><span>Prefer to speak directly?</span><p>You can contact any member of the Lathrop Team by phone or email using the details below.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"contact-form-panel\"><form class=\"form form--contact\"><fieldset class=\"form-fieldset\"><legend class=\"form-legend\">Your details</legend><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">Name<input class=\"form-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your name\" name=\"name\"/></label></div><div class=\"form-row form-row--contact-details\"><label class=\"form-label\">Email<input class=\"form-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" name=\"email\"/></label><label class=\"form-label\">Phone<input class=\"form-input\" type=\"tel\" autoComplete=\"tel\" inputMode=\"tel\" placeholder=\"(920) 555-1234\" name=\"phone\"/></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"form-fieldset\"><legend class=\"form-legend\">Your next move</legend><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">I’m looking to<select class=\"form-input\" name=\"intent\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose an option</option><option value=\"buy\">Buy a home</option><option value=\"sell\">Sell a home</option><option value=\"both\">Buy and sell</option><option value=\"just-curious\">Just exploring options</option></select></label></div><div class=\"form-row\"><label class=\"form-label\">Message<textarea class=\"form-input form-textarea\" name=\"message\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"Tell us a little about what you are considering.\"></textarea></label></div></fieldset><div class=\"form-row form-actions form-actions--contact\"><button class=\"btn btn--primary\">Send message</button><p class=\"form-note\">Your details are used only to respond to your enquiry.</p></div><div class=\"form-status-wrap\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></form></div></section><section class=\"contact-direct-section\"><div class=\"contact-direct-heading\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Direct contact</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">Reach out to<em>the team directly.</em></h2></div><div class=\"contact-direct-grid\"><div class=\"\"><article class=\"contact-direct-card\"><div class=\"contact-direct-card-header\"><div><p>Realtor®</p><h3>Diane Lathrop</h3></div><span>01</span></div><div class=\"contact-direct-card-links\"><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"contact-direct-card\"><div class=\"contact-direct-card-header\"><div><p>Realtor®</p><h3>Shane Lathrop</h3></div><span>02</span></div><div class=\"contact-direct-card-links\"><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></div></article></div><div class=\"\"><article class=\"contact-direct-card\"><div class=\"contact-direct-card-header\"><div><p>Realtor®</p><h3>Oliver Lathrop</h3></div><span>03</span></div><div class=\"contact-direct-card-links\"><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathropteam.com\">oliver@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19208584424\">(920) 858-4424</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"contact-office\"><div class=\"contact-office-mark\">KW</div><div class=\"contact-office-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"editorial-eyebrow\"><span class=\"editorial-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Brokerage office</p><h2 class=\"editorial-section-title\">Keller Williams<em>Fox Cities.</em></h2></div><div class=\"\"><address class=\"contact-office-address\"><strong>Keller Williams Fox Cities</strong><span>517 N. Westhill Blvd, Appleton, WI</span><span>Each office is independently owned and operated.</span></address></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/reviews\">Reviews</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p><strong>Shane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:shane@lathropteam.com\">shane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204280066\">(920) 428-0066</a></p><p><strong>Oliver Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:oliver@lathroptea